Three blocks order three competing rules in a cycle: `a` puts hover before
focus, `b` focus before active, `c` active before hover. No two blocks
disagree on one pair, so there is no conflict, but no sheet order satisfies
all three. generate warns, names the blocks it overrides, and cuts the cycle
at one rule. A block bound to a name is named by its longident from
`[@@@css.bindings]` (found through the block's `_id_` class); an anonymous
block (here `c`, with no `_id_` class) by the `file:line` of its
`[@@@css.blocks]` entry.

  $ cat > m.ml <<EOF
  > [@@@css "._a_hov:hover{color:red;}"]
  > [@@@css "._a_foc:focus{color:blue;}"]
  > [@@@css "._a_act:active{color:green;}"]
  > [@@@css.bindings [("M.a", "_id_a", "_a_hov _a_foc"); ("M.b", "_id_b", "_a_foc _a_act")]]
  > [@@@css.blocks [(5, "_id_a _a_hov _a_foc")]]
  > [@@@css.blocks [(6, "_id_b _a_foc _a_act")]]
  > [@@@css.blocks [(7, "_a_act _a_hov")]]
  > EOF

  $ styled-ppx.generate m.ml
  styled-ppx: blocks m.ml:7 order competing rules in a cycle; the sheet emits ._a_act:active{color:green;} after rules those blocks put after it
  /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually */
  ._a_hov:hover{color:red;}
  ._a_foc:focus{color:blue;}
  ._a_act:active{color:green;}

The cycle is cut at `:active`: of the rules that wait on one block edge, it
is the latest by definition order. The anonymous block `c` loses its order
(an element that is active and hovered gets `green`, not `red`).

Two named blocks that disagree on one pair are named by their longidents:

  $ cat > n.ml <<EOF
  > [@@@css "._a_hov:hover{color:red;}"]
  > [@@@css "._a_foc:focus{color:blue;}"]
  > [@@@css.bindings [("N.first", "_id_f", "_a_hov _a_foc"); ("N.second", "_id_s", "_a_foc _a_hov")]]
  > [@@@css.blocks [(4, "_id_f _a_hov _a_foc")]]
  > [@@@css.blocks [(5, "_id_s _a_foc _a_hov")]]
  > EOF

  $ styled-ppx.generate n.ml
  styled-ppx: blocks N.first and N.second put two competing rules in opposite orders (._a_hov:hover{color:red;} and ._a_foc:focus{color:blue;}); the sheet keeps their definition order
  /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually */
  ._a_hov:hover{color:red;}
  ._a_foc:focus{color:blue;}
